                                1. Minta AA, Ferrari M, Antoni S, et al. Progress Toward Measles Elimination — Worldwide, 2000–2023. MMWR Morb Mortal Wkly Rep 2024;73:1036–1042. DOI: http://dx.doi.org/10.15585/mmwr.mm7345a4
